      "commit": "49d494d4ef0ab11ba78380ec9d19feb4136ffd9d",
      "reason": "AB-330: 49d494d4ef0ab11ba78380ec9d19feb4136ffd9d binds and awaits the ephemeral TCP discovery lifecycle in listen and abortStartup. The abortStartup TCP await follows synchronous mobile retirement so immediate ready=false holds. The close shutdown await was introduced by 99b918121feb08f961cd942fbba1339e80b64994 and remains required to retire the owned listener. Only these three method hashes change; the other ten method hashes, UI hash and behavioral assertions remain unchanged."
    },
    "AB-380": {
      "base": "a185c5787dbbab50698c06cf7c1f098a14c78a25",
      "methods": [
        "src/core/broker.ts:constructor"
      ],
      "commit": "3f75b534",
      "reason": "AB-380: 3f75b534 changes the inlineJobReport handler registered in the constructor to quarantine an oversized report body (same-id stub, full text kept in a file) instead of rejecting it, so an older sender cannot loop on retries. Only the constructor hash changes; the other twelve method hashes, UI hash and behavioral assertions remain unchanged."
    }
  },
